AltoRewardsDistributor::whitelistAdapter
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when adapters whitelist length exceeds MAX_ADAPTERS_WHITELIST
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when adapter is zero address
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when adapter is already whitelisted
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when adapter is valid and not whitelisted
        ├── it should add adapter to whitelist
        └── it should emit WhitelistAdapter event
